\p{\strong{Describes a tool that was removed.} This survey measured \code{\verb~|ir2lean~}, the extractor from LLVM IR, which \pr{15} replaced with \code{\verb~|ast2lean~} ([dec-03IY](dec-03IY)). Its counts and its work list do not apply to the new extractor; it is kept as the record of why the earlier approach was set aside.}

\p{Part of [the survey of extraction](note-extraction-coverage). Generated by \code{\verb~|scripts/survey-extraction.py~}.}

